      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOLLIPOP LOVER (7) is still a maiden after 13 runs but rarely far away, the latest finishing out of the placings when fifth at Sale. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. CRUISE DEVERE (1) is a Daniel Pell-trained newcomer by Christo Bale out of Get Real. Drawn well and should get his chance. Respect any strong moves in the market. MINDS EYE (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.79) at Geelong behind Sky Eagle in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Can feature again. LADY ROWIE (6) is a newcomer from the Sheldon Hamilton kennel. Profiles well so pay to keep very safe.",
